  "description": "What: CE-7015 / CE-4584 (AQ101 \u00a7R, R-4227) - on cqb-village, pc-defend-dry's 'Red Platoon' (three squads of four, Veteran, nerve 0.9) defends OBJ at (121,157) facing south; a Blue 81 mm mortar section at (280,30) fires on it, a barrage the check orders once its crews man the tubes (a Strike converged on Squad 2, 10 bombs a tube). The check engages the platoon (the squads' Set and a SPOT inside the engagement area, as pc-defend-dry). Judge: the bursts near-miss the line's men (UnderFire, stress rises); a VETERAN platoon's line HOLDS (no BreakContact) under the same fire. Report the sim times. Check: python3 scripts/utility-demo-check.py --launch morale-barrage-veteran. \ud83d\udcc4 docs/designs/group-maneuvers/DESIGN_Defend_And_Attack_Position.md DA-67 (CE-7015)"
